      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“日本冠军C”上，\n我要将我的风水之力发挥在跑步上，\n全力击败火山！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4ea65a7d533e28fd28f7d125ef451948c0c1898a4a662e058a87a76ee315add",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
