      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典级的小林历奇与古马级的\n北港火山。两人之间的实力差距\n或许仍相当明显，但即使如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "857ef11fc8bc45ac6e427b1b27512291eb291e6d621a99d9ff6d088025457c0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
